title: Direct The Cabinet
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: chancellor_party != spd_name and vice_chancellor_party == spd_name and cabinet_direct_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/muller_cabinet.jpg
tags: govt_affairs
on-arrival: cabinet_direct_timer += 6; month_actions += 1

= Direct the Cabinet

[? if chancellor_party == spd : With the Chancellorship, we can direct our SPD cabinet ministers to pursue our goals in government?] [? if vice_chancellor_party == spd : With the Chancellorship, we can direct our SPD cabinet ministers to pursue our goals in government?] 

- @foreign: Direct [+ foreign_minister +] to pursue our goals on foreign policy.
- @interior: Direct [+ interior_minister +] to pursue our goals in the interior ministry.
- @justice: Direct [+ justice_minister +] to pursue our goals on judicial policy.
- @labor: Direct [+ labor_minister +] to pursue our goals on labor policy.
- @reichswehr: Direct [+ reichswehr_minister +] to pursue our goals regarding the Reichswehr.
- @economic: Direct [+ economic_minister +] to pursue our goals on economic policy.
- @finance: Direct [+ finance_minister +] to pursue our goals on fiscal policy.
- @agriculture: Direct [+ agriculture_minister +] to pursue our goals on agricultural policy.
- @education: Direct our ministers to pursue our goals on education policy.
- @welfare: Direct our ministers to pursue our goals on welfare. 

@foreign
view-if: foreign_minister_party == spd_name
go-to: foreign_policy

We direct [+ foreign_minister +] to pursue our goals on foreign policy.

@interior
view-if: interior_minister_party == spd_name
go-to: interior_ministry

We direct [+ interior_minister +] to pursue our goals in the interior ministry.

@justice
view-if: justice_minister_party == spd_name
go-to: judiciary

We direct [+ justice_minister +] to pursue our goals on judicial policy.

@labor
view-if: labor_minister_party == spd_name
go-to: labor_affairs

We direct [+ labor_minister +] to pursue our goals on labor policy.

@reichswehr
view-if: reichswehr_minister_party == spd_name
go-to: military_policy

We direct [+ reichswehr_minister +] to pursue our goals regarding the Reichswehr.

@economic
view-if: economic_minister_party == spd_name
go-to: economic_policy

We direct [+ economic_minister +] to pursue our goals on economic policy.

@finance
view-if: finance_minister_party == spd_name
go-to: fiscal_policy

We direct [+ finance_minister +] to pursue our goals on fiscal policy.

@agriculture
view-if: agriculture_minister_party == spd_name
go-to: agricultural_policy

We direct [+ agriculture_minister +] to pursue our goals on agricultural policy.

@education 
go-to: education_science

We direct our ministers to pursue our goals on education policy.
  
@welfare
go-to: social_welfare

We direct our ministers to pursue our goals on welfare. 
